s an opportunity to improve your skills, sharpen your driving, and chase victory.\n\n### Features\n\n* Exciting go-kart racing gameplay\n* Fast-paced kart driving action\n* Challenging racing tracks and sharp turns\n* Responsive driving controls\n* Competitive races and finish-line challenges\n* Engaging racing environments\n* Fun for fans of kart racing and arcade driving games\n\nStart your engine, take your position on the starting grid, and race your way to the finish line in Kart Rush!", "short_description": "Jump into Kart Rush, an exciting go-kart racing game where you speed through challenging tracks, master sharp turns, and compete for racing glory. Start your engine and hit the track!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://uafle.github.io/dwelve/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dwelve", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://uafle.github.io/dwelve/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1416726221513834"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2149607862349262"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1085170260892662"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1085170260892662"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2149607862349262"}]}, "liveC